  "channels": [
    {
      "name": "rules",
      "id": "1532092808595243018",
      "type": "text",
      "overwrites": {
        "@everyone": {
          "deny": ["SendMessages"]
        }
      },
      "messages": [
        {
          "content": "# Rules\n\n1. **Be respectful.** No harassment, slurs or personal attacks: criticize the mod, not the person.\n2. **One report per post.** Open it in the mod's tickets forum and pick the tags that fit.\n3. **Logs as files, not pasted.** Attach `latest.log` or the crash report, or share an mclo.gs link.\n4. **No piracy or redistribution.** Don't share a mod, or repack it in a modpack, against its license.\n5. **English in shared channels**, so everyone can follow along."
        }
      ]
    },
